  "description": "KADNOW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C71 H85 N12 O30 Sm5,3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm5 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.682-3.951 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.45-115.45°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H97N12O33Sm5.",
